[31.575143, "o", "[38;2;255;140;36m\u001b[11;28H                \u2580\u2598\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[12;28H\u001b[K\n  \u001b[38;2;170;170;170mChiefD\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[14;28H  \u001b[38;2;170;170;170mWhat kind of company do you want to create today?\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[15;28H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;255;140;36m\n[Context]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[19;28H  AGENTS.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[20;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;255;140;36m\n[Skills]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[22;28H  manager\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[23;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;255;140;36m\n[Extensions]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[25;28H  company-stop.ts, organization-intercom.ts, team-ui.ts, tribes-welcome.ts\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[26;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;255;140;36m\n[Themes]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[28;28H  organization-mira-sandoval-dark, organization-mira-sandoval-light\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[29;28H\u001b[K\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\n                                                                                                                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[31;28H \u001b[38;2;255;140;36mYou are Mira (mira-sandoval), and nothing is assigned to you: no message is waiting for you. Read y"]
[31.575242, "o", "our AGENTS.md, then say in one line that you are up and        \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[32;28H \u001b[38;2;255;140;36mavailable, and stop there. Do not go looking for something to do \u2014 a file, a repository or a source tree you can see is not work anybody gave you. Create no      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[33;28H \u001b[38;2;255;140;36mdepartment, hire nobody, send no message, and start no work of any kind until somebody asks you for something.\u001b[39m                                                    \u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[34;28H                                                                                                                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[35;28H\u001b[K\n I'm Mira Sandoval, Head of Navigation \u2014 up and available.\u001b[K\u001b[37;28H\u001b[K\n \u001b[38;2;175;175;0mWarning: tmux extended-keys-format is xterm. Pi works best with csi-u. Add `set -g extended-keys-format csi-u` to ~/.tmux.conf and restart tmux.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[39;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;175;175;0m\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
