[38.223779, "o", "H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;0;187;210m\n[Context]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[17;28H  AGENTS.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[18;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;0;187;210m\n[Skills]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[20;28H  manager\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[21;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;0;187;210m\n[Extensions]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[23;28H  company-stop.ts, organization-intercom.ts, team-ui.ts, tribes-welcome.ts\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[24;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;0;187;210m\n[Themes]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;170;170;170m\u001b[26;28H  organization-desmond-vale-dark, organization-desmond-vale-light\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;28H\u001b[K\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\n                                                                                                                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[29;28H \u001b[38;2;0;187;210mYou are Desmond (desmond-vale), and nothing is assigned to you: no message is waiting for you. Read your AGENTS.md, then say in one line that you are up and      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[30;28H \u001b[38;2;0;187;210mavailable, and stop there. Do not go looking for something to do \u2014 a file, a reposito"]
[38.22385, "o", "ry or a source tree you can see is not work anybody gave you. Create no      \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[31;28H \u001b[38;2;0;187;210mdepartment, hire nobody, send no message, and start no work of any kind until somebody asks you for something.\u001b[39m                                                    \u001b[49m\u001b[48;2;52;53;65m\u001b[32;28H                                                                                                                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[33;28H\u001b[K\n \u001b[38;2;0;187;210m\u001b[3mLet me read the AGENTS.md file, then say I'm up and available.\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[K\u001b[35;28H\u001b[K\n I'm up and available as Desmond, Head of Fleet Operations \u2014 standing by for work.\u001b[K\u001b[37;28H\u001b[K\n \u001b[38;2;175;175;0mWarning: tmux extended-keys-format is xterm. Pi works best with csi-u. Add `set -g extended-keys-format csi-u` to ~/.tmux.conf and restart tmux.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[39;28H\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;175;175;0m\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
